    "long_instructions": "TODOs: - Open index.html to view the sample code plan and the AI-generated code. - Read the 'Code Plan' carefully, noting what the button should do. - Observe the initial 'AI-Generated Code' snippet and its rendered output. - Use the 'Prompt Dial' toggles to simulate different AI changes to the button's behavior. - Compare the modified code and the button's action with your original plan. - Identify which aspects of the code match your plan and which do not. - Consider whether you would 'Keep' the result, 'Redirect' the AI, or 'Edit' the code yourself.",
